Z||000070||AkursedX||06-20-2001||01:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>I think my desk is starting to crack because this thread is being displayed on my 19 inch monitor. I guess I better switch it back to my 14 quick!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LMFAO!!!!  Too funny!!<P><BR>On a more serious note, as I said way back in the beginning of this.  I would be more worried about my rims cracking before my body cracking.  I mean, the wheels get the brunt of the force, and the body gets less because it is absorbed by the suspension.  It simply doesn't make sense.  <BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
